    {
      "id": "OAPI32-SS-05",
      "description": "A sequential response publishes itemSchema as the per-value OpenBindings output contract; the co-present complete-sequence schema remains an aggregate artifact constraint [OAPI32-S-01, OAPI32-P-03].",
      "source": {
        "bindingSpec": "openbindings.openapi-3.2@1",
        "content": {
